id: rook-shell
name: Rook
order: 3
optionOf: difference-in-shell
optionEffect: 2
# Pieces of the Hive's Rook chosen: this one.
follows: rook
# On the Insect Shell, in no Quality Slot (racial.mjs platingQuality).
platingQuality: spiked
description: >
  Your base Size Category is Gigantic and your Insect Shell gains the Spiked Apparel Quality without occupying any Quality Slots.
text: >
  Rook [Passive]: Your base Size Category is Gigantic and your Insect Shell gains the Spiked Apparel Quality without occupying any Quality Slots.

---

[passive]
allow size.base.gigantic;
